From eeb579a95f81d3cdfeebcc8f772e40f628508eb9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Geoff Miller <contributor@example.invalid>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 03:54:25 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 15/27] fix(review): reuse coherent graph snapshot for
 review_diff

Share one complete symbol and typed graph across review dimensions. Fence same-watermark patch and drop publications for review and legacy graph callers, and pin indexed identity before finding writes.

Verified: M2 Go 1.26.2 race tests passed for internal/memo, internal/analysis/review, and internal/mcp against exact eight-file source closure. Deterministic tests cover mixed publication, stale legacy graph insertion, read refusal, and index drift. Canonical full gate remains pending.
